      {
        "id": 196567,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-19T13:18:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would like to say that I initially had the same interpretation that Takewalker did, hence my own initial post.</p><p>It was not my intention to \"put words in [Matchstick's] mouth\"; I genuinely initially misread what he said, and so then left it alone once Matchstick clarified and I therefore realized my mistake. I am wagering that Takewalker made the same honest mistake I did.</p><p>So I apologize to Matchstick for coming off as unintentionally hostile and contributing to any resulting derailing of his intentions, but I also feel very uncomfortable at being threatened with mod punishment for not reading something ambigious the right way the first time and needing to seek clarification.</p>",
