      {
        "id": 196568,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-19T14:07:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've just been kind of flabbergasted by the negativity surrounding this campaign. It's one thing to say \"I'm not interested\", but anyone who hasn't wanted to support it, on this forum and others, has come off as genuinely hostile, and just I don't understand why. Obviously, I'm reading things that aren't there, though, and I also apologize to Matchstickman for rogue assumptions on his behalf. :/</p>",
