        "created_at": "2017-04-19T14:23:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Anyways, I'm probably more curious about the intro theme if the video game gets made for this since their plan is to make a separate app as well and it would seem odd to use the normal Sentinels theme in a completely different universe. &nbsp;</p>",
