      {
        "id": 196571,
        "name": "UXM266",
        "username": "UXM266",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/{size}/1966_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-19T14:37:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Anyways, I'm probably more curious about the intro theme if the video game gets made for this since their plan is to make a separate app as well and it would seem odd to use the normal Sentinels theme in a completely different universe. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's a good point, I'm also thinking WHEN the game gets made will it look the same, not so much the art, but the GUI, UI, colors, button placements, etc… I'm just thinking that it would only matter if the video game for SoEP was compatible with the Sotm Video Game.</p>\n<p>These questions are far off, and will be answered at a future date, but I have just tons of questions. I'm not demanding things be a certain way, I am just full with curiosity!</p>\n<p>I'm looking forward to all of this!</p>\n<p>Can't wait for more updates!&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
